    <footer style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:1rem;padding-top:2.5rem;margin-top:3rem;border-top:1.5px solid var(--border);font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:11px;color:var(--muted);flex-wrap:wrap;">
        <span>Dinari Intelligence — RandomForest + GradientBoosting · Devise : DT · Symfony 6.4</span>
